{"title":"Extrema","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The upper and lower bounds of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real_number\" title=\"Real number\">real</a> valued function are of interest in several situations in pure as well as applied <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics\" title=\"Mathematics\">Mathematics</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Absolute_Extrema\">Absolute Extrema</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Extrema&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Absolute Extrema\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be a set\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/e/7eea905af8c70e71e7aa957e63cca30cd2d796f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:A\\rightarrow\\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Let the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/a/03aaf0378607b4e66f9ab51e9af538997ab78cf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> be bounded\n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa8b1c15a6631815e10797d78ae4bf934c44566.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M=\\sup\\{f(A)\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" /> is called the <b>Absolute</b> or <b>Global maximum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /></b> \n</p><p>and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/2/7429a3f5abc6d4f462b3c5aab44c2eebd5246070.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=\\inf\\{f(A)\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"18\" /> is called the <b>Absolute</b> or <b>Global minimum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /></b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Local_Extrema\">Local Extrema</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Extrema&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Local Extrema\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67c320754a36aaec178e61f04bfcbac41c0bf675.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:[a,b]\\rightarrow\\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/4/bc4071cc226c14be7b48b37e48bdf595f88e01cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c\\in [a,b]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/5/f55646bbf92355779b357feafd057262ae76d25d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> is said to be a <b>Local maximum</b> iff <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/c/ddcfbe1c7fc3585c5ee6d45b32526111c2fbddb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\exists\\delta&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb2569c9aaf087f739c5d774fc53e1c06ab43cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(c)=\\sup\\{f(V_{\\delta}(c))\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/5/f55646bbf92355779b357feafd057262ae76d25d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> is said to be a <b>Local minimum</b> iff <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/c/ddcfbe1c7fc3585c5ee6d45b32526111c2fbddb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\exists\\delta&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/b/0eb66785cec59d7cd78f68f7fa2e0b74b26def33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(c)=\\inf\\{f(V_{\\delta}(c))\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"161\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Extrema&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">Function</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Neighbourhoods&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Neighbourhoods (page does not exist)\">Neighbourhoods</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Derivative\" title=\"Derivative\">Derivative</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Extrema&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018084246\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 92/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 262/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2752/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.293      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.293      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6420:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 2